            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"step-3-batch-process-all-queries\">Step 3: Batch Process All Queries</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">We'll process all 200 queries with all 3 strategies.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>This will take a few minutes and cost ~$1-2 in API calls.</strong></span></span>"
