            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"step-5-analyze-where-rewriting-helped\">Step 5: Analyze Where Rewriting Helped</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Let's look at examples where query rewriting rescued failed queries!</span></span>"
