            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"step-6-save-results\">Step 6: Save Results</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Let's save the enhanced results for the final analysis.</span></span>"
