            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"strategy-comparison\">\ud83d\udcdd Strategy Comparison</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Original:</strong></span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">How long do I roast whole garlic heads?</span>\n</blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Keywords:</strong></span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">roast whole garlic heads time</span>\n</blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Rewritten:</strong></span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">roast whole garlic heads oven roasting time temperature recipe</span>\n</blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Expanded:</strong></span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Expanded query with synonyms:</span>\n</blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">\"How long do I roast whole garlic heads? How long to bake, slow roast, or oven-cook entire garlic bulbs? What is the roasting time for full garlic cloves or whole garlic bulbs? How long to cook, caramelize, or brown whole garlic heads in the oven, convection oven, toaster oven, or air fryer? Duration for roasting, baking, or slow-cooking whole garlic bulbs or entire garlic heads wrapped in foil or unwrapped?\"</span>\n<hr />\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Which one looks best?</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>Keywords: Most concise, might miss context</li>\n<li>Rewritten: Balances clarity and brevity</li>\n<li>Expanded: Most comprehensive, might be too broad</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Let's evaluate all three on all 200 queries!</span></span>"
